agent-ops task task-b811bd03-2230-4765-9399-b71a93227d1b: Readable pixel office with persistent work list
intent: Keep the original pixel office art and scene, add a persistent right work list for eight sessions, separate acceptance-check progress from overall completion, keep phase headings unobstructed, preserve read-only CLI-copy interactions and responsive keyboard-accessible drilldown. No new dependencies or control APIs.
criteria:
- readable-work-list: A persistent keyboard-accessible work list exposes each visible actor's full name, current work, phase, task status and pending questions across eight concurrent sessions without relying on rotating dialogue.
- honest-completion: Acceptance checks, verification and review remain separate from task completion; PASS checks with pending review are explicitly unfinished and missing task/progress data is not presented as completed.
- unobstructed-pixel-scene: The existing pixel rooms, avatars, props and movement remain, while the progress board stays within its header lane and never intersects phase headings; the five phases have an ordered readable legend.
- readonly-live-drilldown: Roster entries open existing actor details with full identity and copy existing commands; repository/completion/room/language filters and snapshot refresh keep the work list and details current without adding write APIs.
- responsive-office: The scene and scrollable work list share a desktop layout at 1440x900 and stack at smaller widths; existing keyboard and modal focus controls remain usable and regression tests pass.

